## Search Results: Auto-Dismiss / Auto-Close / Auto-Hide Logic

### PRIMARY FINDING: 5-Second Event Auto-Dismiss (Target of Task #29)

**File:** `D:\Claude Code+DeepSeekV4\city-life-story\src\js\core\events.js`

**Location 1: The auto-dismiss timeout -- lines 1880-1892**

In the function `queueRandomEvent`, after the event modal is shown, a 5000ms `setTimeout` is set up that automatically removes the modal and clears the pending event:

```js
// Line 1879-1892
// 超时兜底：5秒后自动关闭（带倒计时提示）
s._pendingEventTimeout = setTimeout(function () {
    if (s._pendingEventId === evt.id) {
        s._pendingEvent = null;
        s._pendingEventId = null;
        var mo = document.querySelector(".modal-overlay");
        if (mo) mo.remove();
        StateManager.addMessage(
            "⏰ 事件「" + evt.title + "」已自动忽略（超时5秒）",
            "info",
        );
        if (typeof renderAll === "function") renderAll();
    }
}, 5000);
```

**Location 2: The countdown hint displayed to the user -- lines 1942-1944**

Inside `showEventModal`, the modal HTML includes a visible countdown notice:

```html
